WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
Connect: select an authorized provider account.

00:03.000 --> 00:10.000
Sync the connection and confirm that data is ready.

00:10.000 --> 00:15.000
Analyze: compare ad spend, customers, leads and website visits using a sample marketing dataset.

00:15.000 --> 00:20.000
Switch between actual and indexed values to compare changes across different scales.

00:20.000 --> 00:24.000
Choose a chart view and the metric for your decision.

00:24.000 --> 00:30.000
Decide: create a decision linked to the selected dataset and metric.

00:30.000 --> 00:38.000
Record the action, expected outcome and review date, then save the decision.

00:38.000 --> 00:45.000
Review: record what happened and evaluate the outcome against the expected result.

00:45.000 --> 00:52.000
Save the lesson learned alongside the original decision and its evidence.
